  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\" id=\"hero\"><h2 data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\">Your dev environment,<span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\">in your pocket.</span></h2><p data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\">Run agents, terminals, code editor and browser DevTools from your phone.</p><p><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><img src=\"https://shellular.dev/_astro/codex-color.wiAwJTR-.svg\" alt=\"Codex\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"></span><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><img src=\"https://shellular.dev/_astro/claudecode-color.fHzCf3DK.svg\" alt=\"Claude Code\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"></span><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><img src=\"https://shellular.dev/_astro/opencode.CcEm3phd.svg\" alt=\"OpenCode\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"></span><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><img src=\"https://shellular.dev/_astro/hermesagent.DUfTwIy7.svg\" alt=\"Hermes Agent\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"></span><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><img src=\"https://shellular.dev/_astro/cursor.DLwgvbFb.svg\" alt=\"Cursor CLI\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"></span><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><img src=\"https://shellular.dev/_astro/pi.DftRIuYN.svg\" alt=\"Pi\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"></span><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><img src=\"https://shellular.dev/_astro/githubcopilot.C72hirqc.svg\" alt=\"Copilot\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"></span></p><div data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><p><a id=\"testimonials-link\" href=\"#testimonials\" aria-label=\"Read what developers say\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\">RS</span><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\">AS</span><span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\">S</span></a></p><p data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\">Built by the team behind <a href=\"https://acode.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\">Acode</a>, the mobile code editor with <span data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\">4M downloads</span> on Play Store.</p></div><div data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"\"><p><img src=\"https://shellular.dev/_astro/app-home-ss.DFuf-v7S_Z1B3VbQ.webp\" srcset=\"https://shellular.dev/_astro/app-home-ss.DFuf-v7S_JD5vl.webp 360w, https://shellular.dev/_astro/app-home-ss.DFuf-v7S_Z27Ysvl.webp 540w, https://shellular.dev/_astro/app-home-ss.DFuf-v7S_IJweH.webp 720w\" alt=\"Shellular app home screen showing active sessions on the host machine.\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 240px, 320px\" loading=\"eager\" data-astro-cid-ge2uvauf=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1080\" height=\"2340\"></p></div></div><!-- Demo video modal --><div data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\" id=\"features\"><article data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Agents</span></p><h3 data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Run the AI agents you already use</h3><p data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode and the rest — running where your code already lives, controllable from your couch.</p><ul data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Full agent UI from your phone</li><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">No copying context between devices</li><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Pick up the exact session you left</li></ul></div></article><article data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Terminal</span></p><h3 data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">A real terminal in your pocket</h3><p data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Run commands, restart services, tail logs. Not a sandbox, not a fake shell — the same machine you'd sit down to.</p><ul data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Full TTY, full PATH</li><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Session keeps state across reconnects</li><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Touch-optimized chord shortcuts</li></ul></div></article><article data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Localhost</span></p><h3 data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Open your local apps from anywhere</h3><p data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Tunneled access to whatever's running on your machine — dev servers, dashboards, internal tools — without exposing them to the world.</p><ul data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Browse localhost from your phone</li><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">DevTools just work</li><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Encrypted &amp; private</li></ul></div></article><article data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Files</span></p><h3 data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">The same repos, the same files</h3><p data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Touch your actual project files — no sync conflicts, no \"mobile version\". Edit, commit, push, all on the source machine.</p><ul data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\"><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Real git, on the real repo</li><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Supports  TypeScipt, Python, Go &amp; more.</li><li data-astro-cid-cognygiv=\"\">Stage hunks from your thumb</li></ul></div></article></div><div data-astro-cid-ki43kjrb=\"\" id=\"integrations\"><p><span data-astro-cid-ki43kjrb=\"\">Codex</span></p><p><span data-astro-cid-ki43kjrb=\"\">OpenCode</span></p><p><span data-astro-cid-ki43kjrb=\"\">Hermes Agent</span></p><p><span data-astro-cid-ki43kjrb=\"\">Claude Code</span></p><p><span data-astro-cid-ki43kjrb=\"\">Cursor</span></p><p><span data-astro-cid-ki43kjrb=\"\">Pi</span></p><p><span data-astro-cid-ki43kjrb=\"\">Copilot</span></p></div><section id=\"security\" data-astro-cid-qj3fwpa7=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-lgeabl77=\"\" data-astro-cid-qj3fwpa7=\"\"><p data-astro-cid-lgeabl77=\"\">All traffic is end-to-end encrypted — the relay never sees your data. The relay server is <a href=\"https://github.com/shellular-org/server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-astro-cid-lgeabl77=\"\">open source</a>.</p></div><ul data-astro-cid-qj3fwpa7=\"\"><li data-astro-cid-qj3fwpa7=\"\"><p>Data is encrypted on your device before it hits our server, and decrypted only on your phone. The relay just passes it through.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-qj3fwpa7=\"\"><p>All traffic runs over TLS — no unencrypted connections at all.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-qj3fwpa7=\"\"><p>Pairing is done by scanning a QR code that contains the encryption key. It's never transmitted through any network.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-qj3fwpa7=\"\"><p>Every new device must be approved by you on the host before it can connect.</p></li></ul><p data-astro-cid-qj3fwpa7=\"\"><a href=\"https://shellular.dev/security\" data-astro-cid-qj3fwpa7=\"\">Learn more about our security model</a></p></section><!-- Soft wave divider transitioning to the warmer Get Started section --><div data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\" id=\"get-started\"><!-- Step 1 --><div data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\"><p data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\">Download Shellular on your phone. Available for both iOS and Android</p></div><!-- Step 2 --><div data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\"><p data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\">One command on your machine — it connects to the relay and prints a QR code.</p><p><span data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\">npx shellular</span></p></div><!-- Step 3 --><div data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\"><p data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\">Scan the QR code, approve the device on the host, and your full dev environment is in your pocket.</p><p><span data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\">scan QR</span><span data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\">approve</span><span data-astro-cid-eym6cpmn=\"\">live</span></p></div></div><div data-astro-cid-gakqr736=\"\" id=\"testimonials\"></div></div></div>",
